    description: Some("A frenzied bartender works four bars — Old West saloon, jock bar, punk bar and space bar — sliding sodas down the counter to customers advancing on him and catching the empties they fling back. Serving a drink nobody is there to catch costs as much as letting a customer reach you, and between bars the Soda Bandit shuffles six cans for you to pick the one he hasn\'t shaken."),
